  "details": "My pov jitters whenever i move the camera (to top left. top right, bottom left, bottom right), except when i open menu and hold shift for player selection it goes back to normal.  (Video) \n\nI tried on ALL VRCHAT VERSIONS including open beta/unity 6, nothing changed, tried different fps or other settings or other avatars, again the same. \n\nIt was working normally yesterday, all i did after yesterday just restart pc and go back to vrchat and this issue occurred. Even tried other nvidia control panel settings, still same.\n\nAnd it doesn't happen when i hold sprint, but when i move normally (sometimes) or stay station, it goes back to jitter. \n\nSame during loading avatar. (No it's not gogoloco or anything)(I don't have the same issue in other games).",
